OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens when Ms Pac-Man meets
OL,4,AIndian dance?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMs Pac-Man and her 1980s video game
OL,7,Fcontemporaries may not seem the most
OL,8,Fobvious inspiration for classical
OL,9,FIndian dance routines. But three
OL,10,Fperformers are channelling the 8-bit
OL,11,Fcharacters for their latest venture.
OL,13,FBradford Arts Centre has awarded Kavya
OL,14,FIyer, Devaki Rajendran and Sneha
OL,15,FSemaleesan #10,000 for their project to
OL,16,Fcreate semi-improvised Bharatanatyam
OL,17,Fshows.
OL,19,FThe centre's Kala Sangam Commission
OL,20,Fsupports the creation of performance
OL,21,Fwork featuring classical Indian art
OL,22,Fforms.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
